        <content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p>As we enter the season of Advent, we are invited into a posture of watchful waiting. This is a time of preparation, of quiet expectancy, as we look toward the coming of Christ.</p>
<p>Our parish will hold a series of Advent evening prayers each Wednesday throughout the season.</p>
