        <content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p>The Book of Common Prayer has shaped Anglican worship for centuries. In this post, we explore its structure and how it guides our weekly liturgy.</p>
<p>Newcomers are welcome to pick up a printed copy at the parish office, or follow along using the pew cards provided each Sunday.</p>
